1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,389
Eight maybe you're meant to be lonely because being lonely is where all of the magical self discovery happens.
第八，也许你注定要孤独，因为孤独正是所有神奇的自我发现发生的地方。

2
00:00:09,399 --> 00:00:14,240
Because a lot of people believe they're lonely because when they have friends or when they're surrounded by others.
因为很多人觉得自己孤独，是因为他们以为，有了朋友，或身边有人，

3
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:19,829
Or they have the lifestyle that they think they want because they see other people living it that it will make them happy.
或拥有他们看别人过、于是觉得自己也想要的生活方式，就会快乐。

4
00:00:19,839 --> 00:00:21,350
But how is it going to make you happy.
但那怎么会让你快乐呢？

5
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:26,519
Because you're telling me that the second those people aren't near you the second you have to move to a new city alone.
因为按你的说法，那些人一不在附近，或你一需要独自搬到一座新城市，

6
00:00:26,519 --> 00:00:32,150
The second that you go a few weeks without talking to them all of your happiness gets snatched away with that.
或者一连几周没和他们说话，你所有的快乐就被一并抢走了。

7
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:35,560
Your happiness becomes dependent on the actions of other people.
你的快乐就依赖于别人的行为。

8
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:38,959
Why would you ever want to put yourself through that torment and suffering.
你为什么要让自己承受那样的折磨和痛苦呢？

9
00:00:38,959 --> 00:00:47,750
That's why you have been given the gift of loneliness right now to build a foundation of happiness and gratitude all by yourself.
所以，你现在获得孤独这份礼物，是为了独自建立快乐与感恩的基础。

10
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:54,959
So that when you feel that joy when you're with other people and they leave for whatever reason the happiness stays with you.
这样，你和别人一起感到快乐后，即使他们因为任何原因离开，快乐也会留在你身边。

11
00:00:54,959 --> 00:00:57,560
It doesn't affect you as a person it doesn't ruin your life.
它不会影响你这个人，不会毁掉你的生活。

12
00:00:57,560 --> 00:01:03,000
Because if you've watched my videos then you know other people leaving are so important it's it's something to be celebrated.
如果你看过我的视频，就知道别人离开很重要，甚至是值得庆祝的。

13
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:09,000
In fact to outgrow someone means that you are evolving as a person and you are following your true life path.
实际上，超越一段与某人的关系，意味着你在发展，沿着真正的人生道路前进。

14
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:12,440
To leave a toxic friendship means that you finally know your worth.
离开一段有害的友谊，意味着你终于知道自己的价值，

15
00:01:12,440 --> 00:01:17,880
And you're confident in yourself to know that you are worthy and deserving and capable of getting better friends.
也对自己有信心，知道自己值得、应当、也有能力结交更合适的朋友。

16
00:01:17,880 --> 00:01:22,160
And so the reason that you are lonely is so that you can finally take the time to learn about yourself.
所以，你孤独的原因，是你终于可以花时间了解自己，

17
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:24,790
Because you can't love yourself unless you know yourself.
因为除非了解自己，否则你无法爱自己。

18
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:31,839
And when all of your time is spent alone with your own thoughts when you spend your weekends alone at home that's nothing to be ashamed of.
当你总是独自与想法相处、周末独自在家时，那没什么可羞愧的。

19
00:01:31,839 --> 00:01:37,399
That's the time where you figure out your interests when you figure out what your values are when you start building up your set of standards.
那是你弄清兴趣、价值观，开始建立一套标准的时间。

20
00:01:37,399 --> 00:01:42,120
Most people on this planet have never been able to give themselves that level of attention.
这个星球上的多数人，从来无法给自己这样程度的关注。

21
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:47,320
And why would they as human beings we are always chasing the next best thing the next person the next job.
他们又为什么会呢？作为人类，我们总在追逐下一个更好的东西，下一个人、下一份工作，

22
00:01:47,320 --> 00:01:51,079
The lifestyle we want the holiday we want to go on to material things.
我们想要的生活方式、想去度的假，以及物质的东西。

23
00:01:51,079 --> 00:01:55,399
A lot of people don't take the time to actually sit with themselves for even a full day.
很多人连完整的一天都不肯花来真正和自己相处。

24
00:01:55,399 --> 00:02:01,200
And you are given this phase now so that you can protect yourself and build up the necessary foundations of self love.
你现在被给予这个阶段，是为了能保护自己，建立自爱的必要基础。

25
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:04,440
So that you go after a life that is fully and truly meant for you.
这样你就能追求一个真正完全适合你的人生，

26
00:02:04,440 --> 00:02:06,399
Because you took the time to learn about yourself.
因为你花时间了解过自己，

27
00:02:06,399 --> 00:02:12,440
Rather than going after what you think you want or allowing other people to determine what you want so you just follow their lead.
而不是追逐自己以为想要的东西，或让别人决定你想要什么，自己只跟着他们走。

28
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:18,320
This links into number nine in the moments of silence where there is so much stillness.
这就连到第九点：在安静的时刻，一切那么平静，

29
00:02:18,320 --> 00:02:25,639
And there are no distractions and it feels a bit too quiet and lonely that's where the most growth is going to happen for you.
没有干扰，感觉有点过于安静、孤独，那正是你会成长最多的地方。

30
00:02:25,639 --> 00:02:32,600
You are making so much more progress in your life just by being alone and sitting with that feeling.
仅仅独处、与那种感受待在一起，你的人生就正在取得更多进展，

31
00:02:32,600 --> 00:02:39,389
Because now you can fully recognize what you feel and why you feel it and where it's coming from.
因为现在你能完全辨认自己的感受、为什么会这样，以及它来自哪里。

32
00:02:39,399 --> 00:02:44,560
You were building up so much self awareness and when I was at my loneliest.
你在建立那么多自我觉察。而我最孤独的时候，

33
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:50,240
I constantly used to think about the kind of relationships that I wanted and the friendships and the experiences I wanted to have.
我不断想着自己想要的关系、友谊，以及想拥有的经历。

34
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:58,040
And guess what now I have it because I paid so much attention to crafting and visualizing the exact idea of the goal I was suing.
猜怎么着？现在我拥有了，因为我那么专注地雕琢、想象自己“was suing”的目标的具体样子（字幕疑点）。

35
00:02:58,040 --> 00:03:02,600
Not something that I needed it was something I wanted because I was perfectly fine on my own.
那不是我缺不了的东西，而是我想要的，因为我一个人也很好。

36
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:09,959
But I knew exactly what I wanted that I finally exited the phase of my life where I was accepting company for the sake of having friends.
但我很清楚自己想要什么，所以终于退出了那种“只为了有朋友就接受陪伴”的人生阶段。

37
00:03:09,959 --> 00:03:13,680
That when somebody came up to me and they liked me I kind of just let them adopt me.
有人来找我、喜欢我时，我以前就像让他们把我收养了一样，

38
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:16,199
Because at least somebody liked me and that was good enough.
因为至少有人喜欢我，那就够好了。

39
00:03:16,199 --> 00:03:22,480
No the loneliness allowed me to figure out exactly who I want to be in my life.
不。孤独让我弄清，我究竟想要谁在我的生活里。

40
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:27,920
And that way when I was out and about and I was talking to people and meeting people if somebody liked me.
这样，当我外出、与人聊天、认识人时，如果有人喜欢我，

41
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:32,000
That wasn't a green flag that wasn't something to be considered.
那不再是一个绿旗，不再是一个值得考虑的信号。

42
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:36,069
I had so many more standards and things I was aware of that I wanted.
我有了更多标准，也意识到自己想要很多东西。

43
00:03:36,079 --> 00:03:38,320
And I wasn't about to just accept anybody into my life.
我不会随便接受任何人进入自己的生活，

44
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:43,320
Because I know that I am fully deserving of being able to meet all of those standards in my friendships.
因为我知道，自己完全值得在友谊里满足那些标准。

45
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:48,519
When I jumped from friend to friend or relationship to relationship I was constantly stuck in this low vibrational state.
以前我从朋友跳到朋友、从一段关系跳到另一段时，总卡在所谓“低振动状态”里。

46
00:03:48,519 --> 00:03:55,399
And that's because majority of that action was coming from a place of fear because I thought well what if I don't have anybody.
因为其中大部分行动都源于恐惧：我在想，“万一我一个人也没有呢？”

47
00:03:55,399 --> 00:04:00,000
But when you're lonely and and you feel as though you're already in that place you have nothing to lose.
但当你孤独、感觉已经处在那种境地时，你就没有什么可失去的。

48
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:06,519
You only can go up from here you can only grow you can only learn more about yourself you can only set your standards even higher.
你只能从这里向上走，只会成长，只会更了解自己，只会把标准再提高。
